Hello everyone,

A bunch of news.

New version of asmutils (0.17) is available for download:
http://linuxassembly.org/asmutils.html
Thanks to all contributors!

Also, now there's a pure assembly Linux distribution, called a-Linux,
based on Linux kernel and asmutils (it has derived from the asmutils
bootdisk). It will evetually become a completely separate project.
You can download it from the asmutils page too.

Finally, new version of the Linux Assembly HOWTO is released:
http://linuxassembly.org/howto.html

